'''Pelts''' are a [[Currency]] used to purchase various items from {{NPCSprite|Tony's Shop}} and {{NPCSprite|Talbot}}.

== Obtaining ==
Pelts can be obtained from two different NPCs,

=== Trevor ===
{{Main|Trevor}}
Pelts can be obtained by completing {{NPCSprite|Trevor the Trapper;Trevor}}'s tasks. The amount of Pelts received depends on the mob's rarity and any modifiers.

