{{NPCSprite|Trevor the Trapper;Trevor}} also rewards {{Pelts|2}} as a [[Garden]] visitor.

=== Shepherd ===
{{Main|Shepherd}}
Players can also obtain {{Pelts|4}} by completing the {{NPCSprite|Shepherd}}'s quest.

== Usage ==
{{Pelts}} can be used as a currency in two shops, {{NPCSprite|Tony}}'s, which sells T12 Farming minions, and {{NPCSprite|Talbot}}'s which sells various farming items. 

